Third-party data
================

Unfurl's shared food library can be loaded from these public food databases
(backend/app/modules/fitness/food_import.py). The databases themselves are not
part of this repository; the importer downloads them.

USDA FoodData Central
  U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Research Service.
  FoodData Central (Foundation Foods; SR Legacy). https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/
  Public domain (CC0 1.0 Universal).

Open Food Facts
  Contains information from Open Food Facts (https://world.openfoodfacts.org/),
  which is made available here under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0,
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Individual contents of the
  database are available under the Database Contents License,
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/. Product images are not used.
  The app credits Open Food Facts wherever a food from it shows its source.

Philippine Food Composition Tables (PhilFCT)
  Food and Nutrition Research Institute, Department of Science and Technology
  (FNRI-DOST). Loaded only from a file FNRI has given permission to use; none
  is loaded today.
